diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 4fefba0..1ab810f 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -3,6 +3,47 @@
 Release notes are listed newest first. English is followed by Simplified Chinese.
 Test releases are experimental and do not establish real-vehicle compatibility.
 
+## [v0.1.19-test.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+> R32 — projection recovery candidate; not device validated.
+
+- Guard dashboard source geometry; stop stale-layout output and touch after a source size change.
+- Suppress dashboard on the next known-peer connection for ten minutes after a confirmed local pipeline fault; no persistent setting changes.
+- Honor MediaCodec BufferInfo offset and size; avoid starting dashboard GL while the phone does not own the screen.
+- 君越投屏故障降级、尺寸变化保护、编码缓冲区边界校验；尚待实车验证。
+
+## [v0.1.18-test.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+> R31 — GM E2LB conservative projection candidate for the 2023 LaCrosse target. Not vehicle-validated.
+
+- Opt-in dashboard uses explicit receiver geometry, conservative 30 FPS maximum and up to 8 Mbps local encoding, no physical 6K assumption.
+- Adapt media panel to wide displays, retain aspect-fit content and matching touch mapping; unsupported geometry keeps compatibility mode.
+- 君越目标车型适配：仅在 E2LB 自报身份及有效显示能力、开启实验仪表盘时应用保守视频参数。原连接协议不改动，仍需实车验证。
+
+## [v0.1.17-test.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+> R30 experimental projection performance candidate; not compiled or vehicle-validated locally.
+
+### English
+- Coalesce decoded dashboard frames to the negotiated FPS budget; refresh visible dashboard regions only when changed.
+- Bound independent dashboard updates to two seconds after the last source frame; record source age, coalesced frames and texture uploads.
+- Propagate dropped-input generations to the decoder and wait for a fresh IDR; terminate a fatal transcode stream rather than silently stall.
+- Avoid requesting AVC level 4 when frame size/rate exceeds its limits; retain compatibility profile and bitrate policy.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 仪表盘输出节流、局部纹理更新、短时独立刷新及独立性能统计。
+- 解码队列断流后等待关键帧，致命转码错误退出以供会话恢复。
+- 避免超出 H.264 Level 4 规格时仍强制请求该等级，保留原兼容配置。
+- 尚未完成 Android 编译、模拟器出画及实车帧率/画质验收。
+
+## [v0.1.16-test.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+> R29 — experimental receiver-side composition. Not Android-compiled or vehicle-validated.
+
+- Opt-in glass dashboard: decode CarWith video, compose a live viewport and real media metadata, then use the existing encoder and transport.
+- Map touch to the source viewport; isolate media controls and preserve compatibility mode. No independent map provider, app launcher or Apple native renderer yet.
+- 实验性车机投屏仪表盘：实时内容、真实媒体信息、触控映射。默认关闭，暂未真机验证。
+
 ## [v0.1.15-test.1] - 2026-11-25
 
 > R28 — UI review candidate; full Android compilation and device verification pending.
